| ek (pk2) has length 384·k = 1152 | Alg. 13 line 10, Table 3 | ✅ (via `ENCAPSULATION_KEY_SIZE_spec`) |
| dk has length 768·k + 96 = 2400 | Alg. 16, Table 3 | ✅ (via `generate_spec`) |
