            ct2.length = 128 ∧
            -- Step 5: Decaps (FIPS 203 Alg. 21)
            decaps keys.dk ct1 ct2 ⦃ (ss' : Vec U8) =>
              -- Size consistency with FIPS 203 Table 3:
              ss'.length = 32     -- |K'| = 32 (Alg. 21 output)
              -- ∧ ss' = ss       -- K' = K  (FIPS 203 correctness — NOT VERIFIED)
            ⦄ ⦄ ⦄ ⦄ ⦄
```

