### 6e. Ciphertext Completeness Theorem (FIPS 203 Table 3)

The combined ciphertext in FIPS 203 is c = c₁‖c₂ with total size
32·(dᵤ·k + dᵥ). The incremental API produces c₁ and c₂ separately.
The following composition of spec theorems establishes that the
combined size matches FIPS 203 Table 3:

```
