-- From encaps2_spec:  ct2.length = 128
-- Combined:           ct1.length + ct2.length = 1088
--                   = 32·(dᵤ·k + dᵥ) = 32·(10·3 + 4) = 32·34
--                   = FIPS 203 Table 3 ciphertext size for ML-KEM-768  ✅
```

This follows from pure arithmetic on the postconditions of
`encaps1_spec` and `encaps2_spec`. It confirms that the incremental
decomposition of encapsulation into two phases preserves the FIPS 203
total ciphertext size.

