The shared secret K is a 32-byte value derived from G(m‖H(ek))
where G = SHA3-512 (FIPS 203 §4.1, Eq. 4.3):
  G : 𝔹* → 𝔹⁶⁴, and K = G(m‖H(ek))[0:32]

