#### Origin Theorem O6: Incremental ek Reconstruction (pk1, pk2 → FIPS 203 ek)

The FIPS 203 encapsulation key ek ∈ 𝔹^(384k+32) decomposes as:
  ek = ByteEncode₁₂(t̂) ‖ ρ  (Alg. 13 line 10)

The incremental API splits this differently:
